```
id: SPL-017
name: Account lockout spike
description: Many distinct accounts locked out within a short window.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Credential Access
mitre_technique: T1110 Brute Force
severity: Medium
data_source: index=wineventlog (Security)
false_positives: Password policy change, expired service credentials.
tuning: Tune the count to estate size; correlate with the source of failures.
test_method: Lock out several lab accounts with repeated wrong passwords.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4740 earliest=-1h
| bin _time span=15m
| stats dc(user) AS locked_accounts values(user) AS accounts values(Caller_Computer_Name) AS caller_hosts BY _time
| where locked_accounts>=5
| sort - locked_accounts
